  Composition -> WidgetShell chrome (ListMusic icon + "Media History" title + freshness chip + refresh
    + optional Open) · COMPACT (cols<=1): single "{title} — {artist}" row over a 44pt min-height, or the
    inline empty row · FEED (cols>=2): scrollable timeline of rows (play-tinted music marker + connector,
    "{title} — {artist}", source label, relative time). Recharts->none / Leaflet->none (no chart/map).
    The web decorative "🎵 " title prefix is rendered Apple-idiomatically as the leading SF Symbol
    (music.note) rather than an inline emoji literal.
  States (all render) -> loading (skeleton rows) · empty ("No tracks played", ContentUnavailableView) ·
    error (retry) · stale (chip + banner over cached feed) · offline (cached feed + chip + banner) ·
    content. Model phase resolution keeps cached rows visible behind refresh/errors, matching the web
    shell (skeleton only on initial fetch; empty only when there are no rows).
